osmium-tool
------------------------------------------
A multipurpose command line tool for working with OpenStreetMap data based on
the Osmium library.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libboost_program_options1.66-1.66.0-1
  libbz2_1-1.0.8-2
  libexpat1-2.9.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  liblz4_1-1.9.4-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  zlib0-1.3.2-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libbz2-devel-1.0.8-2
  libexpat-devel-2.9.0-1
  liblz4-devel-1.9.4-1
  libosmium-2.23.1-1bl1
  make-4.4.1-2
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  nlohmann_json-3.12.0-1bl3
  protozero-1.8.2-1bl1
  zlib-devel-1.3.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/osmcode/osmium-tool

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/osmcode/osmium-tool/archive/refs/tags/v1.19.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack osmium-tool-1.19.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./osmium-tool-1.19.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/osmium-tool-1.19.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/osmium-tool-1.19.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(osmium-tool)
  /usr/bin/osmium.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/osmium-tool.README
  /usr/share/doc/osmium-tool/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/osmium-tool/README.md

